  vendorName: Botanist Huxley
  offerText: Purchase this massive, rare glowing fern. It requires a lot of coin
    and most of your floor space, but it is a true botanical marvel.
  acceptResultText: The giant plant completely dominates the room. Surprisingly,
    the glowing spores it releases immediately clear your lungs and cure your chronic
    fatigue! You feel amazing.
  rejectResultText: You refuse to buy the oversized weed. Your room stays clear and
    your money stays safe, though the air remains dreadfully stale.
